    "detailed_description": "Welcome to a charming retro-style 3D platformer inspired by classic PS1 collect-a-thons. In this game, you play as Mars, a brave tiger on a quest to restore the lost memories of Princess Mia by exploring her dream world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342340/extras/65a6bcd130f332bf0f9979ba5945013f.poster.avif?t=1706105485\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342340/extras/65a6bcd130f332bf0f9979ba5945013f.webm?t=1706105485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342340/extras/65a6bcd130f332bf0f9979ba5945013f.mp4?t=1706105485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game offers colorful and delightful dreamscapes filled with endearing characters. Mars can run, jump, and dash through levels, unlocking new areas as you progress.<br><br>The game's low-poly models and retro video effects create a nostalgic atmosphere, transporting players back to a simpler time. Additionally, the game features an original, hand-crafted soundtrack that further enhances the immersive experience.<br><br>Overall, this game offers a fun and engaging gameplay experience for fans of classic platformers. Join Mars on his journey to restore Princess Mia's lost memories and explore a charming dream world filled with vibrant characters.",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to a charming retro-style 3D platformer inspired by classic PS1 collect-a-thons. In this game, you play as Mars, a brave tiger on a quest to restore the lost memories of Princess Mia by exploring her dream world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342340/extras/65a6bcd130f332bf0f9979ba5945013f.poster.avif?t=1706105485\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342340/extras/65a6bcd130f332bf0f9979ba5945013f.webm?t=1706105485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342340/extras/65a6bcd130f332bf0f9979ba5945013f.mp4?t=1706105485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game offers colorful and delightful dreamscapes filled with endearing characters. Mars can run, jump, and dash through levels, unlocking new areas as you progress.<br><br>The game's low-poly models and retro video effects create a nostalgic atmosphere, transporting players back to a simpler time. Additionally, the game features an original, hand-crafted soundtrack that further enhances the immersive experience.<br><br>Overall, this game offers a fun and engaging gameplay experience for fans of classic platformers. Join Mars on his journey to restore Princess Mia's lost memories and explore a charming dream world filled with vibrant characters.",
